The DEBUG commit rewound CMakeLists.txt, src/main.cpp, src/Global.cpp and
src/GameManager.cpp to bcddaa2.  Cause: build.sh resets those files to the base
commit with `git checkout bcddaa2 -- <files>`, which writes both the worktree
and the index; re-applying the patches afterwards only touched the worktree, so
the commit captured the base versions.

build.sh is changed to reset only the worktree (`git checkout bcddaa2 --` then
`git reset --` is not enough either) - see the accompanying note.  This commit
restores the four files to their patched content.
